{#
  The wiki index's Markdown: the header, a heading for each first letter
  with its pages listed under it, and the footer.

  `wikiGroups` is the HTML layout's, each a `letter` and its `pages`, and
  each page a `label`, a `url` and a `description`. `content` holds the same
  list as the CMS would write it. Autoescaping is off; print text through
  `escapeMarkdown` and links through `markdownUrl`.
-#}
{{ header }}

{% for group in wikiGroups %}
## {{ group.letter | escapeMarkdown }}

{% for entry in group.pages %}
- [{{ entry.label | escapeMarkdown }}]({{ entry.url | markdownUrl }}){{ (": " + (entry.description | escapeMarkdown)) if entry.description }}
{% endfor %}

{% endfor %}
{{ footer }}
